#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:1 d34f2af8a8eb4daf91cbf849efa05abe
msgid "NEP Dataset Display 操作演示"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display walkthrough"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:3 d2f7ad086d8a4a34bdb025831085a2f9
msgid ""
"本页带你完成一次最短的“打开数据 → 看图 → 选结构 → 导出”流程。动图只演示操作位置； "
"参数含义和算法原理请进入对应的[功能指南](../module/NEP-dataset-display.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This page walks through the shortest workflow: open data → inspect plots "
"→ select structures → export. The animations show only where to click; "
"see the corresponding [Feature Guide](../module/NEP-dataset-display.md) "
"for parameter meanings and algorithm principles."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:6 2e22e01bf9dc42abaeee765dece75826
msgid "开始前准备什么"
msgstr "Before you start"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 38594348bf024f59a1531ced2d5a4614
msgid "我手里的文件"
msgstr "Files you have"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 861a16b9c1554ccca8bf421fe9a3ce37
msgid "可以做什么"
msgstr "What you can do"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md bcdf1d101362451bba781e178f880869
msgid "只有 `train.xyz`"
msgstr "Only `train.xyz`"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md f83c0c5a4cba400b8fad7b7ccc26f964
msgid "查看结构、标签和已有 DFT 数据"
msgstr "Inspect structures, labels, and existing DFT data"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 349d2a4614054510b6d68b3d42953533
msgid "`train.xyz` + `nep.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 3ae403e049be461088951cb9cf0dc377
msgid "重新预测并比较 NEP 与参考值"
msgstr "Run predictions again and compare NEP with reference values"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 55e72e5d3ac54accab0ac1dda9e51454
msgid "`train.xyz` + `energy/force/virial_*.out`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md 1a9710efbf724fa2ade2e4d99f63fde2
msgid "直接回看 GPUMD 已输出的训练或测试结果"
msgstr "Review training or test results already produced by GPUMD"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:14 70c9cf5a9e0f4b78b4c85bb4866a5537
msgid "如果文件不能导入，先按文件类型查看[支持格式](../formats.md)，不要反复更改扩展名尝试。"
msgstr ""
"If a file cannot be imported, first check [Supported "
"formats](../formats.md) for its file type instead of repeatedly changing "
"the extension."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:16 778a039f13d54a74bc0242623fd909db
msgid "1. 打开结构和模型"
msgstr "1. Open the structure and model"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:18 62333d47bf68484f9722d8218fafae30
msgid ""
"把 `train.xyz` 拖入窗口，或从顶部 `Open` 菜单选择结构文件。需要现场计算预测值时， 再打开 "
"`nep.txt`；只查看已有标签时不必加载模型。"
msgstr ""
"Drag `train.xyz` into the window or choose a structure file from the top "
"`Open` menu. Open `nep.txt` only when you need on-the-fly predictions; "
"loading a model is unnecessary when viewing existing labels."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:21 acc353fbce9b4decae9d9ef0212ba29b
msgid "![拖入结构文件并加载数据](../_static/image/example/display/import.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Drag in a structure file and load "
"data](../_static/image/example/display/import.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:21 5f8d390a3bfd46478e01ea9837f35c70
msgid "拖入结构文件并加载数据"
msgstr "Drag in a structure file and load data"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:21 5f8d390a3bfd46478e01ea9837f35c70
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/import.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:23 bed1741e28124f26bb1dd1166fd30a29
msgid "看完动图后检查："
msgstr "After the animation, check:"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:25 bc6940afaf084b7e9c3f3e7f2fcf3cc4
msgid "顶部和状态栏显示的结构数量是否与文件一致；"
msgstr ""
"whether the structure count at the top and in the status bar matches the "
"file;"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:26 929cc404bda04c9daa52ff89864564a7
msgid "主图区是否出现能量、力或 virial 图；"
msgstr "whether energy, force, or virial plots appear in the main area;"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:27 57d4dc634e3b4a62b732f6c4a26258f6
msgid "结构区能否显示当前帧。没有标签的数据不会凭空出现误差图。"
msgstr ""
"whether the structure view can display the current frame. Data without "
"labels cannot produce error plots by itself."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:29 51e3fb57773f457a8f355bdb5dc4320c
msgid "2. 逐帧查看结构"
msgstr "2. Inspect structures frame by frame"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:31 eed30518269b4ba4b398dd549094b95a
msgid "点击播放按钮可按当前顺序逐帧切换结构。播放只改变当前显示帧，不会删除、重新排序或修改数据。"
msgstr ""
"Click the play button to switch through structures in the current order. "
"Playback changes only the displayed frame; it does not delete, reorder, "
"or modify data."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:33 4ec73ff73dc94920b2130a4ec93f902a
msgid "播放结构序列"
msgstr "Play the structure sequence"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:33 4ec73ff73dc94920b2130a4ec93f902a
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/play.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:35 5ef6410c8d544e208bd730f806719c33
msgid "![播放并逐帧查看结构](../_static/image/example/display/play.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Play and inspect structures frame by "
"frame](../_static/image/example/display/play.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:35 62bf651f2c714416bd6bce20824067a5
msgid "播放并逐帧查看结构"
msgstr "Play and inspect structures frame by frame"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:35 62bf651f2c714416bd6bce20824067a5
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/play.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:37 dd47b5b48b8740abb594300e0e1724ef
msgid "发现明显异常时先暂停，再记录当前结构编号或将其标记。大数据集不适合只靠播放检查， 应结合误差、几何过滤和搜索条件缩小范围。"
msgstr ""
"Pause when you spot an obvious anomaly, then record or mark the current "
"structure index. Large datasets should not be checked by playback alone; "
"narrow the search with errors, geometry filters, and search conditions."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:40 d93934939b4746f4bef34bd3dc4650c8
msgid "3. 从最大误差回到原结构"
msgstr "3. Return to structures from the largest errors"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:42 08bdb0297f7f4f2a8382d018da1980d9
msgid "最大误差工具按当前图中参考值与预测值的差异找结构。能量图通常一行对应一个结构； 力图会先把原子分量映射回结构并去重。"
msgstr ""
"The maximum-error tool finds structures by the difference between "
"reference and predicted values in the current plot. An energy plot "
"usually has one row per structure; a force plot maps atomic components "
"back to structures and deduplicates them."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:45 53014a51838c4264a817b8108c4e9be0
msgid "![按最大误差选择结构](../_static/image/example/display/maxerror.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Select structures by maximum "
"error](../_static/image/example/display/maxerror.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:45 deed7dadbfab43768caf8cb4a5ab8d08
msgid "按最大误差选择结构"
msgstr "Select structures by maximum error"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:45 deed7dadbfab43768caf8cb4a5ab8d08
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/maxerror.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:47 95142fadeccd4cf7ad44061b8daaabae
msgid ""
"运行后不要只看“选中了多少个”。点击几个被选结构，确认异常来自真实的数据缺口， "
"而不是短键、错误晶胞、错误元素或标签损坏。详细规则见[最大误差筛选](../module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md)。"
msgstr ""
"After running, do not look only at the number selected. Open several "
"selected structures to confirm that the anomaly is a real data gap rather"
" than a short bond, wrong cell, wrong element, or damaged label. See "
"[Maximum-error filtering](../module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md) for the "
"detailed rules."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:50 7265c344576a42ddb3ac7b7b6fa98b9a
msgid "4. 用 FPS 选择代表结构"
msgstr "4. Select representative structures with FPS"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:52 bed06fb28b484dbeba8ce29dbf451514
msgid "FPS 根据描述符距离从候选池中选择分散的代表结构。它适合减少已经清洗过的候选池， 不负责判断结构是否物理合理。"
msgstr ""
"FPS selects well-separated representative structures from a candidate "
"pool using descriptor distances. It is suitable for reducing a pool that "
"has already been cleaned, but does not judge physical validity."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:55 5ef6410c8d544e208bd730f806719c33
msgid "![使用 FPS 选择代表结构](../_static/image/example/display/fps.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Use FPS to select representative "
"structures](../_static/image/example/display/fps.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:55 cb4192550bbf4a968e71c49a470362bb
msgid "使用 FPS 选择代表结构"
msgstr "Use FPS to select representative structures"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:55 cb4192550bbf4a968e71c49a470362bb
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/fps.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:57 f3fe6a27fe08404ba355679d10100d78
msgid ""
"运行前先确认候选池已清除明显坏结构；运行后检查实际选择数是否因最小距离或 $R^2$ "
"阈值提前停止。算法和多种模式见[代表性采样](../module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Before running, confirm that obvious bad structures have been removed "
"from the candidate pool. Afterward, check whether the actual selection "
"count stopped early because of the minimum distance or $R^2$ threshold. "
"See [Representative sampling](../module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md) "
"for the algorithm and available modes."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:60 8828fcbeb59740b0b788b3aa71459d7f
msgid "5. 在图上直接框选或反选"
msgstr "5. Box-select or invert selection directly on the plot"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:62 11d344ba4d004fe4b43473dc1bbc8a9d
msgid "鼠标选择适合处理肉眼可辨的局部点群。先切到选择模式，在图中框选点，再使用反选或清除选择 调整范围；选择会同步回结构列表。"
msgstr ""
"Mouse selection is useful for locally visible point groups. Switch to "
"selection mode, box-select points in the plot, then invert or clear the "
"selection to adjust the range; the selection is synchronized with the "
"structure list."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:65 23b41630cc5744a29569028b4cff4bab
msgid "![在散点图中框选和反选](../_static/image/example/display/mouse.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Box-select and invert selection in a scatter "
"plot](../_static/image/example/display/mouse.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:65 057fba8baf4f4bcd93d68f67d7124187
msgid "在散点图中框选和反选"
msgstr "Box-select and invert selection in a scatter plot"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:65 057fba8baf4f4bcd93d68f67d7124187
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/mouse.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:67 6862013c51c94487b3f9c3e557e5e96b
msgid "图上一个点不一定总等于一个结构：在力图和 virial 分量图中，同一结构可能贡献多行数据。 导出前应回到结构列表确认最终结构数量。"
msgstr ""
"One point in a plot does not always equal one structure: a structure can "
"contribute multiple rows in force and virial-component plots. Return to "
"the structure list and confirm the final count before exporting."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:70 71519c4787cc4f30a56f8d4024ba2696
msgid "6. 按 `Config_type` 组合筛选"
msgstr "6. Filter by `Config_type` combinations"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:72 19edf830c6a0404f87461a47fb273be3
msgid "切换到标签筛选后，可以组合多个 `Config_type` 标签定位来源相近的结构。这个字段通常记录 生成卡片、计算批次或数据来源，不是化学式。"
msgstr ""
"After switching to label filtering, combine multiple `Config_type` labels"
" to locate structures with similar origins. This field usually records "
"the generating card, calculation batch, or data source; it is not a "
"chemical formula."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:75 f37f8a4bc73e4f8e9d92dc4316f7e85b
msgid "![按 Config_type 组合筛选](../_static/image/example/display/config1.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Filter by Config_type "
"combinations](../_static/image/example/display/config1.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:75 1f6f5b1a67624f5d9d0369bc63435f07
msgid "按 Config_type 组合筛选"
msgstr "Filter by Config_type combinations"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:75 1f6f5b1a67624f5d9d0369bc63435f07
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/config1.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:77 0ad6610b14854869b80436a77ee8a69b
msgid ""
"如果标签命名不统一，先用[批量编辑结构元数据](edit-structure-metadata.md)整理，再建立筛选条件。 "
"完整表达式和元素筛选方式见[筛选栏](../module/nep-display-filter.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If label names are inconsistent, first organize them with [Batch-edit "
"structure metadata](edit-structure-metadata.md), then create filter "
"conditions. See [Filter bar](../module/nep-display-filter.md) for "
"complete expressions and element-filtering syntax."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:80 b827995c73dd4d80ae8e45e47c9dead1
msgid "7. 只导出确认过的子集"
msgstr "7. Export only the confirmed subset"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:82 93aee207b16f42b7968dea465fc0c57c
msgid "完成标记后，从 `Save` 菜单选择导出当前活动结构或所选结构。导出前最后确认状态栏中的 活动数、选中数和删除数，避免把已排除结构重新写回文件。"
msgstr ""
"After marking the structures, use the `Save` menu to export the active or"
" selected structures. Before exporting, confirm the active, selected, and"
" deleted counts in the status bar so excluded structures are not written "
"back to the file."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:85 23b41630cc5744a29569028b4cff4bab
msgid "![导出清洗或筛选后的结构](../_static/image/example/display/save.gif)"
msgstr ""
"![Export cleaned or filtered "
"structures](../_static/image/example/display/save.gif)"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:85 0582bcf196b249c9af21295e304106ba
msgid "导出清洗或筛选后的结构"
msgstr "Export cleaned or filtered structures"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:85 0582bcf196b249c9af21295e304106ba
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/display/save.gif"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:87 e788605a78c4499894de5fc2df3a04e2
msgid ""
"建议使用能表达阶段的文件名，例如 `candidate_pool_clean.xyz` 或 "
"`max_error_review.xyz`。导出格式和字段保留规则见[支持格式](../formats.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Use filenames that describe the processing stage, such as "
"`candidate_pool_clean.xyz` or `max_error_review.xyz`. See [Supported "
"formats](../formats.md) for export formats and field-preservation rules."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:90 5fb2bf8bcc224bd6b96625b76a7d8644
msgid "下一步查哪里"
msgstr "Where to go next"

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:92 1659aaf73d92452a90484163a9edaafc
msgid "不认识主图区按钮：看[主图区工具](../module/nep-display-main-plot-tools.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Do not recognize a main-plot button? See [Main plot tools](../module/nep-"
"display-main-plot-tools.md)."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:93 805b99851c8e474e921dccfb03b2b906
msgid "不认识结构区按钮：看[结构区工具](../module/nep-display-structure-tools.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Do not recognize a structure-view button? See [Structure-view "
"tools](../module/nep-display-structure-tools.md)."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:94 8721e823d0f949fca21d78e2c57630b2
msgid "不会导入、导出或切换模型：看[打开数据与切换模型](../module/nep-display-open-data.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Need help importing, exporting, or switching models? See [Open data and "
"switch models](../module/nep-display-open-data.md)."

#: ../../source/example/NEP-display.md:95 e4f6cb52188d494b98cd6ab14e74e62d
msgid "页面没有图、数量不对或工具不可用：看[状态栏与常见提示](../module/nep-display-status-and-errors.md)。"
msgstr ""
"No plots, incorrect counts, or unavailable tools? See [Status bar and "
"common messages](../module/nep-display-status-and-errors.md)."

